  "notes": "{刺|さ}す is a godan verb meaning to stab, pierce, or sting.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{刺|さ}さる→刺さる：02110_sasaru⟧ (intransitive, to be stuck in)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{蚊|か}→蚊：04294_ka⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{刺|さ}される→刺さる：02110_sasaru⟧: to be bitten by mosquito\n- ⟦{虫|むし}→虫：02262_mushi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{刺|さ}される→刺さる：02110_sasaru⟧: to be stung by insect\n- ⟦ナイフ→ナイフ：01039_naifu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{刺|さ}す: to stab with a knife\n\nHOMOPHONES (all さす):\n- {刺|さ}す: to stab, sting\n- ⟦{指|さ}す→指す：02056_sasu⟧: to point at\n- ⟦{差|さ}す→差す：17637_sasu⟧: to hold up (umbrella), to shine\n- ⟦{挿|さ}す→挿す：02466_sasu⟧: to insert, plug in\n- ⟦{注|さ}す→注す：02467_sasu⟧: to pour (drinks)",
